id: pm-web-ummd
title: Isolate CommonJS test executables from ambient scratch-root package metadata
description: "Release fixtures depend on ambient scratch-root context: extensionless CommonJS fake CLI scripts inherit an ESM package scope, failing eight assertions across extension routes, spawn fallback and project routes. A scratch root nested inside the checkout instead leaks ancestor pm-ops into two omit-dev scenarios. A dedicated external root with explicit CommonJS scope and scratch Git isolation passes the suite. Harden fixture isolation in a separate test-infrastructure change."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
